      "observation_ids": [
        "53918319fa5043f0a46e15c86629e481:observation-0018"
      ],
      "source_text": "Some numbers are not ours to produce in the draft. The capital gains tax on any disposal, and the platform and adviser fee rates, are confirmed or inserted by a person before the report goes to the client, so the draft must not estimate or invent them. We do need a way to flag these clearly for manual review in the output, so whoever finalises the report can see exactly what is outstanding and fill it in. How you mark them is your call, but a number we made up must never reach the client, and the gaps must not be hidden.",
